I arrive at my flat.
I open the door.
I step inside.
My umbrella is wet.
I put the umbrella near the door.
I go to the living room.
I open the window.
There is no heat at all now.
A nice cool breeze comes inside.
It is pleasantly cool in the room now.
Outside, it is raining heavily.
I stand near the window.
I look outside.
The weather is very beautiful.
I feel very happy.
I enjoy this cool breeze.
